.TH ag-provenance-attach 1  "attach 0.3.0-beta.1" 
.SH NAME
ag\-provenance\-attach \- Sign and attach a provenance record to a changeset
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag provenance attach\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-task\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-\-prompt\-file\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-rationale\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-\-input\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fB\-\-agent\fR> [\fIREV\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sign and attach a provenance record to a changeset
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\fR \fI<AGENT>\fR
Agent name (its key signs the record)
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-\-run\fR \fI<RUN>\fR
Run id
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-task\fR \fI<TASK>\fR
Task id
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR
Model identifier
.TP
\fB\-\-prompt\-file\fR \fI<PROMPT_FILE>\fR
File holding the prompt; only its SHA\-256 is stored
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-\-rationale\fR \fI<RATIONALE>\fR
Why the change was made
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR \fI<CHECKS>\fR
A check the agent ran itself (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-input\fR \fI<INPUTS>\fR
A source consulted (repeatable). Stored as untrusted text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIREV\fR]
Changeset (default: the workspace head)
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0\-beta.1
